I step outside slowly.
Today is Sunday.
This street is very peaceful.
I walk forward.
A gentle breeze is blowing in Kochi.
A dog is standing on the road.
I remember my dog Lola.
My family is in Mexico.
Their voice is in my mind.
I remember my sister Sofia.
I also remember my brother Diego.
I am not sad now.
I walk back to the room.
